BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 686.89 Td (- It keeps the same advice pipeline reusable for diabetes, stroke, and hypertension.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.5 Tf 50.00 654.39 Td (14. Final Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 625.39 Td (The advice module is a controlled RAG layer built on top of the diabetes, stroke, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 608.89 Td (hypertension prediction modules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 585.39 Td (The prediction models answer "What is the risk?". The advice module answers "What should the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 568.89 Td (user know or do next?".) Tj ET
