BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 512.39 Td (returns a short safe answer with sources and a medical safety note.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 50.00 488.89 Td (This architecture improves usability while keeping medical safety boundaries clear.) Tj ET
